In practice
-----------

You need a legitimate copy of Kingpin: Life of Crime to use anything built here;
the game library is useless without the retail engine and game data.

Building this for your own use is what the SDK was published for. Redistributing
it — the source or a compiled gamei386.so / gamex86.dll — is not covered by any
permission the rights holders have given, however common the practice has been
since 1999.

If you are a rights holder and want something here changed or removed, open an
issue and it will be dealt with.
